public class PremiumLedger { static class Gym{int[]h=new int[10]; int n;void fee(int x){h[n++]=x;}int total(){int t=0;for(int i=0;i<n;i++)t+=h[i];return t;}int[] history(){return java.util.Arrays.copyOf(h,n);}} static class Premium extends Gym{@Override void fee(int x){super.fee(x/2);}} public static void main(String[]x){Premium p=new Premium();p.fee(200);System.out.println(p.total());}}
